1.0.13 - 2026-11-16

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]悬停物品按 G 查询配方时，会核对带标签原料的具体要求，避免把仅有相同标签的物品误判为可用原料。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]The G-key recipe lookup checks the requirements for tagged ingredients against the hovered item before listing matching recipes.
[/list]

1.0.12 - 2026-11-15

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]Nico 工坊的成就与奖励、配方查询和设置支持语言扩展 Mod 提供的语言。缺少的词条会逐条回退到英语。
[*]Mod 列表优先显示已加载的 Mod 名称译文。切换语言后，已打开的 Nico 工坊也会刷新。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Nico Workshop achievements and rewards, recipe lookup and settings support languages added by other mods. Missing entries fall back to English.
[*]The mod list uses translated names supplied by loaded mods. An open Nico Workshop refreshes when the language changes.
[/list]

1.0.11 - 2026-11-12

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]Nico 工坊的「立业有成」在买下店铺或还清房贷、取得店铺产权时记录。已经取得产权的旧存档，打开 Nico 工坊时会补记这项成就。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Nico Workshop now records Established Proprietor when you buy the store outright or pay off its mortgage. Opening Nico Workshop also records the achievement in older saves where you already own the store.
[/list]

1.0.10 - 2026-11-12

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]修复 Mod 物品透明边缘无法起拖的问题。食品加工等 Mod 物品现在可从实际占用格内的透明区域拖动。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Mod items, including those from Food Processing, can now be dragged from transparent areas inside their occupied cells.
[/list]

1.0.9 - 2026-11-12

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]新增「档案箱扩容」开关，默认开启。可在 Forge 的模组设置中关闭，重启游戏后生效。
[*]关闭扩容后，旧存档有物品占用额外格子时会先自动整理。全部物品排进原版格子后恢复原版尺寸，整理失败时保留扩容和原摆放。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Added an option to expand dossier capacity, enabled by default. Turn it off in the Forge mod settings and restart the game to apply.
[*]With expansion off, loading an older save with items in extra slots triggers an automatic sort. If all items fit, the dossier returns to its original size. If sorting fails, the expanded size and layout are kept.
[/list]

1.0.8 - 2026-11-09

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]为 Mod 列表、制造终端、工坊成就、电话与配方界面加入九种语言。切换语言时，Mod 名称和原版物品名称随之更新。
[*]电话选项超过原生按钮数量时会分页。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Added nine languages to the mod list, crafting terminal, workshop achievements, phone and recipe screens. Mod names and base game item names update when the language changes.
[*]Phone choices now split into pages when they exceed the number of available buttons.
[/list]

1.0.7 - 2026-11-07

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]当固定模组效果说明与物品自身说明相同时，只显示一次，避免节点提示重复。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Show fixed module effect text only once when it matches the item's own description, avoiding duplicate node tooltips.
[/list]

1.0.6 - 2026-11-05

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]移除 Nico 工坊处理成就时对原生存档的主动拦截，避免工坊忙碌状态使游戏跳过保存。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Removed the Nico Workshop's active block on native saving while achievement operations are in progress.
[/list]

1.0.5 - 2026-11-04

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]新增「启用 N 键打开成就」设置，默认开启。关闭后仍可拨打 1016 打开 Nico 工坊。
[*]G 键和成就详情仅在有相关配方时打开查询。指向空处按 G 可浏览已登记的全部配方。
[*]全域制造终端有可用配方时才加入博士供货和拾荒掉落。
