[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Added an enabled-by-default setting for the N key achievement shortcut. Dial 1016 to open Nico Workshop when the shortcut is disabled.
[*]The G key and achievement details open recipe lookup only when relevant recipes exist. Point at empty space and press G to browse all registered recipes.
[*]The Universal Manufacturing Terminal appears in Doctor stock and scavenging loot only when it has available recipes.
[/list]

1.0.4 - 2026-11-03

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]等待机械本地化表异步加载完成后，再安装固定模组能力和液体价值补丁，避免补丁初始化同步等待该表。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Fixed module ability and liquid valuation patches now wait for the Mechanic localization table to finish loading asynchronously, avoiding a synchronous wait during patch initialization.
[/list]

1.0.3 - 2026-11-03

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]新增原生机器逐批分派边界；每批完成补料、电力事务结算及出料后再开始下一批。
[*]修复共享电网供电时，批量熔炉因上一批扣电事务未释放而只加工一批的问题；失败时仅补偿当前批次，保留已完成批次。
[*]保留机器原有生产回调及 Target，请同时更新机核协议至 1.0.2。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Native machine batches now finish restocking, power settlement and output collection before the next batch begins.
[*]Fixes batch furnaces stopping after one batch on shared-grid power because the previous debit transaction remained open. Failure restores only the current batch and preserves completed batches.
[*]Preserves existing machine callbacks and their Targets. Update Mechcore Protocol to 1.0.2 at the same time.
[/list]

1.0.2 - 2026-11-03

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]液体价值账本改用有固定容量的多项缓存，减少不同容器交替读取时的重复 JSON 编解码。
[*]继续核对实时容量、全部组分及账本文本；内容变化或外部编辑会重新验证，缓存不持有游戏物品或 Unity 对象。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Liquid value ledgers use bounded multi-entry caches to avoid repeated JSON work when alternating between different containers.
[*]Live capacity, every component and ledger text remain checked. Changed or externally edited data is revalidated; cached entries retain no game items or Unity objects.
[/list]

1.0.1 - 2026-11-02

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]保留机器原有的生产回调，减少与其他 Mod 读取或扩展机器加工行为时的冲突。
[*]夜间、加速器及调试加工继续执行补料、出料与失败电力补偿；自定义机器在第二阶段进料斗工作前完成加工。
[*]统一手动加工入口，请同时更新自动化物流至 1.0.1。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Preserves original machine production callbacks to reduce conflicts with other mods that inspect or extend machine processing.
[*]Night, booster and debug processing retain restocking, output collection and failed-work power compensation. Custom machines finish before the second hopper stage.
[*]Unifies manual processing. Update Automated Logistics to 1.0.1 at the same time.
[/list]

1.0.0 - 2026-10-31

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]全域制造终端的模组舱改为原版未扩容布局，制造、商店供货和掉落均从初始容量开始，使用“模组舱扩充”分两次升级，读档沿用原版扩容等级。
[*]工坊标题与页面切换合并为带主题图标的顶部标签栏，当前页以青色文字和底线标示；NicoKobo 标识置于标题前，官网 nicokobo.com 置于右上角，移除底部品牌栏与多余留白。
[*]工坊名片说明显示官网 nicokobo.com，以及按 N 或拨打电话 1016 打开工坊的提示；移除名片双击激活效果，附言改为“为游戏添加特殊的成就路线”。
[*]移除“成就解锁网络”标题与名片上的“已禁用”提示；载入名片后刷新说明与附言，使已有名片显示当前文案。
[*]原版十项成就全部重绘为统一像素风图标：水牌、大鼠、金属锭、酒瓶、工具箱、扫描仪、金币、店铺、声望徽记和通关奖章；星图中央显示奖章。
[*]工坊和配方查询接入窗口输入拦截，覆盖点击、双击、原生射线及关闭后的鼠标松开；工坊刷新不释放当前手势，关闭配方后继续保护工坊。
[*]成就仅在打开对应标签页时校验；关闭、保存和库存变动不扫描，已有达成记录保留，通关事件单独记录。
[*]恢复“原版”十项成就星图、达成记录和奖励；立业有成领取后恢复本周目 NPC 收购预算翻倍。
[*]工坊分组标题移到固定栏，节点状态增加底色与间距；配方查询显示在工坊上层，刷新成就时保持可见。
[*]Nico 工坊改为赛博风解锁网络：原创电路底板、切角金属节点框、物品图标、前置箭头与状态配色；详细说明移到独立滚动栏，修复多行按钮文字重叠。
[*]补齐档案箱至少 16×16 的原位扩容，保留原版升级的 17 列；首次保存前收纳开局文档，历史分支不重新整理。
[*]提供独立的 NicoKobo Forge 前置，支持内容包共享配方、生产回执、机器物流、供电与供货服务。
[*]提供固定模组能力和 G 配方查询所需的公共接口；内容包保留各自的物品、配置和存档身份。
[*]使用正式版内置 ModLoader，按独立 Mod 安装和启用。
[*]完善复制槽身份、奖励收据及液体与机器持久化读写，保留原生物品身份和普通保存流程。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Prepared the first full-release standalone NicoKobo Forge prerequisite with service protocol 1; content mods retain their own gameplay, configuration, items and save identities.
[*]Centralized machine catalogs, cross-stack selection, whole-batch space checks, transfers, liquids and valuation, power, nightly queues, supply and fixed abilities.
[*]Provides G recipe lookup, universal manufacturing and shared workshop, phone, visitor-dialogue and reading-window implementations.
[*]Nico Workshop restores ten vanilla-goal achievements, real reward claims and per-run persistence. Goals are checked on opening their page while existing qualifications and claims remain. The business achievement restores the run's doubled NPC buying budget.
[*]The workshop uses unified pixel icons, an unlock graph, themed tabs and a separate scrolling details area. Recipe lookup remains above it, with native pointer capture through clicks, double-clicks and window close.
[*]The workshop card explains the N and phone 1016 routes, refreshes its text after loading and no longer uses double-click activation.
[*]Universal manufacturing starts with the native module bay. Dossiers expand in place to at least 16×16, retain the native 17-column upgrade and collect opening documents before the first new-run save.
[*]Improved copied-slot identity, reward receipts and liquid / machine persistence while retaining native item identities and normal saves.
[*]Uses the built-in full-release ModLoader as an independently installed and enabled prerequisite, without the Demo loader.
[/list]
